flowchart TB
    Q["1. User asks a question"]
    EMB["2. Embed question<br/>Embedding model"]
    SEARCH["3. Vector search<br/>Top 5 relevant chunks"]
    GRAPH["4. Graph expansion<br/>Find related code — 1 hop"]
    FETCH["5. Retrieve passages<br/>Seed and related artifacts"]
    SELECT["6. Select context<br/>Rank, deduplicate and apply byte budget"]
    LLM["7. LLM generates answer<br/>Using selected passages"]
    ANSWER["8. Return answer<br/>With sources and citations"]

    Q --> EMB
    EMB --> SEARCH
    SEARCH --> GRAPH
    GRAPH --> FETCH
    FETCH --> SELECT
    SELECT --> LLM
    LLM --> ANSWER